  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_m"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hope I didn't keep you waiting. The L.G.D. meeting took a little longer than expected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't worry about it, Madam Ch'en."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(She looks like nothing ever happened...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How's the situation?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Our scout team has already sent back some information."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I went through it and picked out a few things that might interest you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah, Inspector Hoshiguma..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't worry about me. I'm just going to listen in."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Continue, Amiya. It's fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Very well. We managed to get a lead from some Infected..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The scout team has already confirmed that there are several Reunion hideouts in Lungmen's residential district."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A number of Reunion squads are already planning to launch an attack against Lungmen's defenses."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We even found an infiltration channel that Reunion had been using."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hah. Such arrogance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They seem to be underestimating the L.G.D."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What about the ruins of Chernobog?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Rhodes Island dispatched multiple recon squads there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "While most of the residents were gone, we did find many Reunion members still active there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "One team even had more than three encounters with Reunion forces."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "However, based upon the intel we have, we are unable to conclusively link the movements in the city to any broader Reunion operations..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I would recommend choosing this city as one of our important operation targets in the future."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...I see."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hoshiguma, help bring me my forms. Third drawer on the left side of my desk."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right now? Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Continue."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mm, to summarize..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Rhodes Island suggests a joint operation to completely eliminate the remaining Reunion forces in Lungmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The L.G.D. will not permit it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...What? Madam Ch'en...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I said, no."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You... are an Infected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If you carry out any more missions in the slums, you'll only cause greater disorder."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is our decision."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But--"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah, excuse me, I need to take this call..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is Amiya."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is, is this Amiya?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...! Jessica?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, Jessica here..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you on a stealth mission? I can barely hear you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We found them in the city ruins..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Reunion's leaders..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There are... two of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So, you fled back here with your tail between your legs?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I am no mongrel like you and your lowly kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...If not for the fact that you completed your mission, I would have added two more scars to your filthy face."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Didn't you lose all your limbs in that explosion? I'd feel sorry making a kid like you put makeup on my face with your mouth."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Pah."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But let's set this aside for now... It's not doing either of us any good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll admit to that much."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then, have they taken the bait?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Surely. Let's just see if that old flag-waver can bring back the real goods."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Speaking of which, you're pretty scared of that old timer, aren't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm already in a bad mood."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh my, sorry 'bout that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But that's just before we land the catch, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How about we put aside our differences for the time being?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Tch. Fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll deal with the small fry first."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Rhodes Island, I know you're there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...It's impossible to hide from me."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Jessica, don't!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It could be a trap...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He found us! We have to..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If we defeat the enemy leader... We have to...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh. They really were here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Where'd you come from, little kitty~?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You can't just treat this place like your playground."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey, you bunch."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yessir!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Before we get to feast upon the most sumptuous prey..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Help yourself to the appetizers."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ohhh... Ohhhhh! !"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Tsk...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
